      "exact_quote": "The abstract operation ToBoolean takes argument <var>argument</var> (an <emu-xref href=\"#sec-ecmascript-language-types\" id=\"_ref_2071\"><a href=\"#sec-ecmascript-language-types\">ECMAScript language value</a></emu-xref>) and returns a Boolean. It converts <var>argument</var> to a value of type Boolean.",
